  handle. The workflow keeps running in the background. As it produces progress updates (it already
  emits these via SSE for the existing batch runner UI), the realtime runner forwards them into the
  graph as local rule events — on_workflow_progress:generate_account_summary,                        
  on_workflow_complete:generate_account_summary. The active agent can react to these: play filler
  audio, give status updates ("still pulling that up"), or wait for completion and then speak the
  result.

